Para. 4 let. a — Amended by Annex 5 No II 1 of the O of 15 Nov. 2023 on Placing Fertilisers on the Market, in force since 1 Jan. 2024 (AS 2023 711).

:PATH
Chapter 3 Commencement
|

:INFO
Art. 94
This Ordinance comes into force on 1 July 2015.

